  <section class="v4-home-rent"><a class="v3-shell" href="/use-cases/rent-as-a-utility-qatar"><div>${label("New flagship strategy blueprint")}<h2>Rent-as-a-Utility: Embedded Finance for Qatar's Rental Economy</h2><p>Replace cheque-heavy rent collection with consented billing, regulated settlement and transaction-level reconciliation. The source economics remain explicitly modeled.</p><b>Open the flagship case <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></b></div><figure aria-label="Rent payment orchestration"><span>Lease</span><i></i><span>Consent</span><i></i><span>Billing</span><i></i><span>Payment</span><i></i><span>Settlement</span><i></i><strong>Reconciliation</strong></figure></a></section>
